  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner capacity development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to strengthen partner capacity in managing development projects that will effectively address prioritised issues of rural poor communities. This seeks to support partners on approach and tools to promote greater community participation and ownership, and to enhance the ability of partners to demonstrate positive changes through improved evidentiary process and M&amp;E mechanism. Specific capacity of partners that will be improved through this partner-personalised training project is:

&#x2022;	Best practices and Participatory project design and community need assessment
&#x2022;	Development of community ownership and decision making in project
&#x2022;	People led development approach
&#x2022;	Result based management: baseline and M&amp;E data management</narrative>
  </description>
